      ":question/problem": "The joint probability mass function $f(x, y)$ for the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given below.\n\n| $f$ | $Y = 2$ | $Y = 3$ | $Y = 4$ |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| $X = 1$ | $0.1$ | $0.05$ | $0.15$ |\n| $X = 2$ | $0.1$ | $0.35$ | $0.25$ |\n\nIf $E[X] = 1.7$ and $E[Y] = 3.2$, calculate the covariance of $X$ and $Y$.\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question."
